# Deliberately non-conforming fixture. No file under this directory is ever
# compiled or analyzed, so this configuration governs nothing.
#
# It exists so the rule asserting that the attribute-inserting check stays
# disabled can be shown to fail: the check is enabled below, uncommented, which
# is the exact shape that would mechanically reintroduce the site-level
# attributes the scope fence forbids.
---
Checks: '-*,
modernize-use-nodiscard,
'
